{"seq":1,"slug":"why-order-theory","title":"为何序理论：一套骨架套住万物的先后","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/order-lattice-theory/foundations/why-order-theory","wordCount":1508,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"为何序理论-一套骨架套住万物的先后\">为何序理论：一套骨架套住万物的先后</h1><p>整数的大小、集合的包含、自然数的整除、类的继承、编译任务的依赖、CRDT 副本的版本演进——这些场景表面上八竿子打不着，可只要问一句「谁不排在谁后面」，它们立刻显出同一副骨架。序理论就是研究这副骨架的学科：它把一切具体载体抽走，只留下一个二元关系 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\le</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span></span></span></span></span>，然后追问——仅凭这一条关系，我们还能推出多少结构。答案是惊人地多，多到足以支撑整个程序语义与静态分析的地基。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-序是被抽象出来的-先后\">核心概念：序是被抽象出来的「先后」</h2><p>代数关心「怎么把两个东西合成一个」（加、乘、并、交），序关心的是另一件事：「两个东西谁在前」。二者视角互补。序理论的起点是发现，大量不同领域共享同一个关系模式。下表把几个典型例子并列，你会看到同一副骨架反复出现。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>载体</th>\n<th>序关系 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a \\le b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 的含义</th>\n<th>是否任意两元素可比</th>\n<th>有最小元</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>整数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">Z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbb{Z}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6889em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbb\">Z</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span> 数值不大于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>是（全序）</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>计数、比较</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>幂集 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>S</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>⊆</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a \\subseteq b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⊆</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 子集包含</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>有（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∅</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varnothing</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6633em;vertical-align:-0.0817em;\"></span><span class=\"mord amsrm\">∅</span></span></span></span></span>）</td>\n<td>集合运算、类型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自然数整除</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a \\mid b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> (<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span> 整除 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span>)</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>有（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>）</td>\n<td>数论、最大公约</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>类型继承</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 的子类型</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>视语言而定</td>\n<td>类型系统、子类型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>任务依赖</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span> 必须先于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 完成</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>视图而定</td>\n<td>调度、构建系统</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这些例子里，「整数」这一行是全序——任意两元素都能比大小；其余几行都是偏序——存在互不可比的元素，比如 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\{1\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\{2\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span> 谁也不包含谁。序理论真正的威力，恰恰在处理这种「比不出来」的情形，这也是它区别于日常「排序」直觉的地方。偏序的精确定义与画法在 <a href=\"posets\">偏序集与 Hasse 图</a> 一篇里正式展开。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[&quot;一个二元关系 ≤&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;自反 + 反对称 + 传递&lt;br/&gt;= 偏序&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; C[&quot;任意两元素可比&lt;br/&gt;= 全序 (如整数)&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; D[&quot;存在不可比元素&lt;br/&gt;= 真偏序 (如子集)&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt; E[&quot;任两元素有 sup 与 inf&lt;br/&gt;= 格&quot;]&#10;  E --&gt; F[&quot;任意子集有 sup 与 inf&lt;br/&gt;= 完备格&quot;]&#10;  F --&gt; G[&quot;单调映射必有不动点&lt;br/&gt;= 语义与分析的地基&quot;]\">graph TD\n  A[\"一个二元关系 ≤\"] --&gt; B[\"自反 + 反对称 + 传递&lt;br/&gt;= 偏序\"]\n  B --&gt; C[\"任意两元素可比&lt;br/&gt;= 全序 (如整数)\"]\n  B --&gt; D[\"存在不可比元素&lt;br/&gt;= 真偏序 (如子集)\"]\n  D --&gt; E[\"任两元素有 sup 与 inf&lt;br/&gt;= 格\"]\n  E --&gt; F[\"任意子集有 sup 与 inf&lt;br/&gt;= 完备格\"]\n  F --&gt; G[\"单调映射必有不动点&lt;br/&gt;= 语义与分析的地基\"]</pre><h2 id=\"序视角为什么独立于代数视角\">序视角为什么独立于代数视角</h2><p>抽象代数从「运算」出发：给一个集合配上满足若干公理的二元运算，得到群、环、域。序理论从「关系」出发，看起来像是另起炉灶，但两者常常在同一个对象上相遇。以整除为例——<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">N</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>∣</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(\\mathbb{N}, \\mid)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathbb\">N</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 既是一个偏序，其上确界又恰好是最小公倍数、下确界是最大公约数，于是同一个集合上「序」与「运算」严丝合缝地对上了。这种「序诱导出运算」的现象正是格的雏形，将在 <a href=\"../lattices/lattice-definition\">格的定义</a> 中系统处理。</p>\n<p>关键区别在于：代数运算要求「结果唯一且总存在」，而序只要求「能否比较」。因此序是更弱、更基础的假设。很多结构，你还没来得及定义运算，就已经有了天然的序——比如程序状态的「信息量多少」、近似值的「精确程度」。序理论允许我们先在这层薄薄的假设上工作，等需要时再逐步加码到格、完备格。抽象代数对「运算」的系统处理见 <a href=\"../../abstract-algebra/foundations/from-numbers-to-structures\">抽象代数：从数到结构</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"对偶-买一送一的思维杠杆\">对偶：买一送一的思维杠杆</h2><p>序理论有一条几乎白送的红利：对偶原理。把关系 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\le</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span></span></span></span></span> 整个翻转成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ge</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span></span></span></span></span>，得到的仍是一个合法偏序，称为对偶偏序。于是每证明一条关于「上界、上确界、最大」的定理，翻转一下就白得一条关于「下界、下确界、最小」的定理，不必重新证。上确界（join，记 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∨</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vee</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∨</span></span></span></span></span>）与下确界（meet，记 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∧</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\wedge</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∧</span></span></span></span></span>）就是这样一对对偶概念。</p>\n<p>这条原理贯穿全 hub：Knaster–Tarski 定理里最小不动点与最大不动点成对出现，Galois 连接里左伴随与右伴随互为镜像，都是对偶的具体化身。学序理论时养成「证一条就想它的对偶」的习惯，能省掉一半力气。对偶的精确表述放在 <a href=\"posets\">偏序集</a> 的对偶原理一节。</p>\n<h2 id=\"一个贯穿始终的例子-可达状态的单调增长\">一个贯穿始终的例子：可达状态的单调增长</h2><p>把序理论的动机落到一个具体计算场景上。设想一个程序反复往一个集合里加元素、从不删除——比如「已知可达的网页」在爬虫里只增不减。用集合包含 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>⊆</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\subseteq</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⊆</span></span></span></span></span> 作序，每一步操作都把当前状态 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 映射到一个不更小的状态 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⊇</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(x) \\supseteq x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⊇</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span>。直觉告诉我们，这个过程最终会「稳定」在一个再加也不变的集合上，那正是不动点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(x^*) = x^*</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∅</mi><mo>⊆</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∅</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⊆</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∅</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⊆</mo><mo>⋯</mo><mo>⊆</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varnothing \\subseteq f(\\varnothing) \\subseteq f^2(\\varnothing) \\subseteq \\cdots \\subseteq x^*, \\qquad f(x^*) = x^*</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord amsrm\">∅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⊆</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord amsrm\">∅</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⊆</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1141em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord amsrm\">∅</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⊆</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">⋯</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⊆</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个朴素直觉，一旦搬到完备格上并要求 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span> 单调，就是 Knaster–Tarski 与 Kleene 不动点定理的内容，将在 <a href=\"../fixpoints/knaster-tarski\">Knaster–Tarski 不动点</a> 严格证明。爬虫的可达集、数据流分析的活跃变量、类型推断的约束求解，本质上都是这同一个「单调迭代到不动点」的故事。序理论之所以值得学，正因为它把这类反复出现的模式一次性讲清楚。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>序理论只保留「谁不比谁大」这一条关系，抽掉具体载体后，整数、子集、整除、类型、依赖共享同一副骨架。</li>\n<li>全序（任意可比）只是特例，序理论的核心价值在于处理「比不出来」的真偏序。</li>\n<li>序视角与代数视角互补：序更弱更基础，常在同一对象上诱导出运算，成为格的雏形。</li>\n<li>对偶原理让每条定理白送一条镜像定理，是贯穿全 hub 的思维杠杆。</li>\n<li>「单调迭代到不动点」是序理论最有用的母题，贯穿爬虫、数据流分析、类型推断。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>下一步正式定义偏序：<a href=\"posets\">偏序集与 Hasse 图</a></li>\n<li>序诱导出的运算结构：<a href=\"../lattices/lattice-definition\">格的定义</a></li>\n<li>母题的严格版本：<a href=\"../fixpoints/knaster-tarski\">Knaster–Tarski 不动点</a></li>\n<li>互补的代数视角：<a href=\"../../abstract-algebra/foundations/from-numbers-to-structures\">抽象代数：从数到结构</a></li>\n<li>集合、关系、函数的基础记号：<a href=\"../../discrete-mathematics/sets-and-logic/relations-functions\">离散数学：关系与函数</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"为何序理论：一套骨架套住万物的先后","id":"为何序理论-一套骨架套住万物的先后"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：序是被抽象出来的「先后」","id":"核心概念-序是被抽象出来的-先后"},{"level":2,"text":"序视角为什么独立于代数视角","id":"序视角为什么独立于代数视角"},{"level":2,"text":"对偶：买一送一的思维杠杆","id":"对偶-买一送一的思维杠杆"},{"level":2,"text":"一个贯穿始终的例子：可达状态的单调增长","id":"一个贯穿始终的例子-可达状态的单调增长"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"偏序集与 Hasse 图：三条公理与一张图","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/order-lattice-theory/foundations/posets"}}